FORMAT: 1A
HOST: https://connection.keboola.com

# Storage API

**Apiary is gone. This blueprint is no longer maintained and is kept only as a signpost.**

The Storage API reference now lives at **<https://api.keboola.com/?service=storage>**.

`keboola.docs.apiary.io` is retired and will not be updated.

## Where the documentation lives now

| What | Where |
|:---|:---|
| Rendered reference | <https://api.keboola.com/?service=storage> |
| OpenAPI document (per stack) | `GET /api/storage/doc.json`, Swagger UI at `/api/doc/storage` |
| Source of truth | `#[OA\...]` attributes on `connection/src/Controller/Storage/**/*Action.php` and the request/response DTOs under `connection/src/Storage/**` |
| API-wide prose (status codes, authentication, async calls, headers) | `connection/config/packages/nelmio_api_doc.yaml`, `areas.storage.documentation` |
| How to write the attributes | `docs/AI/Instructions/openapi_attributes.md` |

Deep links use the OpenAPI tag anchor, for example
<https://api.keboola.com/?service=storage#tag/Development-Branches>.

## Regenerating the document

```
docker compose run --rm cli composer openapi:storage:dump   # -> openapi/storage.json
```
